<title>VENEZUELA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT VENEZUELA 5-2 IN WORLD CUP GAME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT VENEZUELA 5-2 IN WORLD CUP GAME.</headline>
<dateline>SAN CRISTOBAL, Venezuela 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat Venezuela 5-2 (halftime 1-1) in a South American World Cup qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Venezuela - Gabriel Savarese (7th minute), Rafael Dudamel (87)</p>
<p>Argentina - Ariel Ortega (35), Juan Sorin (69), Diego Simeone (77), Jose Albornoz (91)</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
